[{"id":2571252742,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6ZQjQG","state":"COMMENTED","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, it causes a significant performance regression in debug builds when reading a high-bitrate 1080p60 video despite using a high-end CPU.\r\n\r\n<details open>\r\n\r\n<summary>PC specifications</summary>\r\n\r\n- **CPU:** Intel Core i9-13900K\r\n- **GPU:** NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090\r\n- **RAM:** 64 GB (2×32 GB DDR5-5800 C30)\r\n- **SSD:** Solidigm P44 Pro 2 TB\r\n- **OS:** Linux (Fedora 41)\r\n</details>\r\n\r\nSee these 120 FPS videos of the running project which should showcase frame drops clearly:\r\n\r\n### Before\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3ef35318-8f94-4e33-b994-35ec7800e7a3\r\n\r\n### After\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/47ecf982-cad9-4937-9545-439b1d5ad004\r\n\r\nSource video file: https://0x0.st/8Xbm.ogv\r\n\r\nThankfully, this is not reproducible when using an optimized editor build (`production=yes lto=full`), but I worry about low-end and mobile CPUs here.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/101958#pullrequestreview-2571252742","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/101958","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-01-23T23:39:36Z"},{"id":2613475570,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6bxnjy","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"00fb5c4df5b686d0526db47b960727a45067d5a0","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserc